“ SCHEDULE C [Section 7]

(1) Every application for enrolment in any grade of Corporate Members shall:- (a) be made to the Honorary General Secretary of the Council;

(b) be in such form as may be provided for the purpose by the Honorary General Secretary of the Council;

(c) state the qualiﬁ cations by virtue of which the applicant is eligible for enrolment in that grade and be supported by an afﬁ davit as to such qualiﬁ cations;

(d) be signed by the applicant;

(e) be accompanied by the amount of the appropriate application fee, entrance fee and membership fee; and

(f) be recommended by two members of the Council or by four members of the Institute of whom one shall be a Fellow, one

