“relatives”, in relation to a deceased person or amissing person include the followingpersons:–

(i) spouse;

(ii) children;

(iii) parents ;

(iv) brothers or sisters;

(v) parents-in-law, brothers/sisters-in-law,sons/daughters-in-law;

(vi) grandchildren and grandparents;

“reparations” include, individual and collectivereparations.

