3.The general objects for which the body corporate isestablished are —

(a) to secure and archive the instruments of the Centre;

(b) to facilitate research activities of graduate andpostgraduate courses on aesthetic studies; and

4.The objects of the Centre shall be carried out in suchmanner so as not to create any conflict between the work ofthe Centre and any work being carried out simultaneouslyby any Ministry or Department of the Government or of anyProvincial Council or “Amaradeva Foundation”.

