9.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Centre shall have the power—

(a)to accept and receive books, documents, files,photographs, films, disks, audio and video tapes,significant personal belongings and souvenirs ofthe childhood and youth of late Pandith W. D.Amaradeva, his creations and collections withpersonal interest, official portraits, grants, awardsand gifts received by him to be deposited, and totake all measures to secure, archive, administer andexhibit those instruments;

