from Sri Lanka or any other cause, the President may appointany other appointed member to act as Chairman in additionto his normal duties as an appointed member.

9.A person shall be disqualified from being appointedor continuing as a member of the Board, if he—

(a)is or becomes a member of Parliament or of anyProvincial Council or of any local authority;

(b) is not or ceases to be a citizen of Sri Lanka;

(c) is under any law in force in Sri Lanka or any othercountry found or declared to be of unsound mind;

(d) is a person who having been declared insolvent orbankrupt under any law in force in Sri Lanka and isan undischarged insolvent or bankrupt;

(e) is serving or has served a sentence of imprisonmentimposed by any court in Sri Lanka or in any othercountry;

(f)holds or enjoys any right or benefit under anycontract made by or on behalf of the Foundation; or

(g) has any financial or other interest as is likely toaffect prejudicially the discharge by him of hisfunctions as a member of the Board.

