28. Where the Committee recommends the impositionof a definitive safeguard measure, the Minister in charge ofthe subject of Finance in consultation with the Ministershall, within a period of fourteen working days of the date ofreceipt of the recommendation of the Committee and takinginto consideration the interests of the national economy,determine whether or not to adopt such safeguard measure.

